type: software
title: Spinal-Multiple-Myeloma-SEG models benchmarking
message: >-
  If you use this software or its evaluation results, please cite this software
  using the metadata below. If you also use the trained model weights, cite their
  separate Zenodo archive: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19708429.
