version: 1.0.0
repository-code: https://github.com/MISAG-BUT/Spinal-Multiple-Myeloma-SEG-models-benchmarking
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Benchmarking code, evaluation results, figures, and tables for nnU-Net-based
  multiple myeloma lesion segmentation on dual-energy CT, comparing conventional
  CT, virtual monoenergetic images, and calcium-suppressed reconstructions.
  The associated benchmarking manuscript is in preparation and has no DOI.
